name=frontend-design
version=1.0.0
description=Create distinctive, production-grade frontend interfaces with high design quality. Use when: building or styling web components, pages, layouts, or applications (landing pages, dashboards, React components, HTML/CSS), or beautifying any web UI. Works from the app's DESIGN.md and gates token changes on design-lint.
argument_hint=Optional: the app or component you're designing/styling
requires=
next_step=Add a design-lint Nx target|This skill gates any DESIGN.md or token change on `pnpm exec nx run <app>:design-lint`. An app without that target (and a pinned `@google/design.md` devDependency) lets token drift through unchecked.|the app being styled has no `design-lint` target in its project.json
